      "archive_timestamp": "20251203192257",
      "article_id": "article_5ba1e86a2dd831ab",
      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "Open-source inference frameworks such as NVIDIA TensorRT-LLM, SGLang and vLLM support these optimizations for MoE models. SGLang, in particular, has played a significant role in advancing large-scale MoE on GB200 NVL72 , helping validate and mature many of the techniques used today.",
      "entity_name_normalized_hint": "advancing large-scale MoE on GB200 NVL72",
